// D9570: a list literal whose element is a record of an un-annotated function, read at an index
// and handed to an un-annotated parameter that calls the field. No record type is declared, so
// the element has no declared row to borrow. Every cell prints `4`.
//
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@PRELUDE@@
function inc0(a) { return a + 1 }
function take(a) { print(a.f(3)) }
// @@VALUE@@
[{ f: inc0 }]
// @@TYPE@@
{ f: (a: i32) => i32 }[]
// @@PROOF@@
take(v[0])
// @@WANT@@
4
// @@SKIP@@
is_in_if: the value is a list, not a union — there is no arm to test it against
is_in_while: same
is_in_and: same
is_in_not: same
else_if: same
early_return_guard: same
